                      <formatted-text>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>The list on the left gives you a recommendation of meal for 1 combos which are consistent of 60 AED amount max, </run>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>so the partner can discount the combo and have a 30 AED meal</run>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>. </run>
                        <run fontalignment='2'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>It does a mix and match between 2 or more categories from the vendor&apos;s menu, as long as it doesn&apos;t go beyond 60 AED. </run>
                        <run fontalignment='2'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>One combo will have one item only for each category and the possible combinations will prioritize 3 items, then 2. The combos are ranked based on the item sold amount in the last 3 months for each vendor. </run>
