                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>The list on the left gives you a recommendation of meal for 1 combos which are consistent of 6 KWD amount max, </run>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>so the partner can discount the combo and have a 3 KWD meal</run>
