                        <run fontalignment='2'>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>It does a mix and match between 2 or more categories from the vendor&apos;s menu, as long as it doesn&apos;t go beyond 6 KWD. </run>
