                        <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#411517' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='11' italic='true'>One combo will have one item only for each category and the possible combinations will prioritize 3 items, then 2. The combos are ranked based on the item sold amount in the last 3 months for each vendor. </run>
